# Directories of instance-owned pre-commit guards, one per line.
#
# Each line is a directory of *.sh guards shipped inside an instance's own repo,
# so they survive a fresh clone (unlike .git/hooks/). Every guard decides its own
# scope and prints nothing when the repo is out of scope; a non-zero exit blocks
# the commit. Missing directories are skipped silently — this file is shared
# across machines and clone locations differ, so list every plausible path rather
# than assuming one.
#
# Guards that are genuinely universal belong in this hook itself, not here.

~/src/vibrant-america-working-agent/githooks/guards.d
~/personal_project/vibrant-america-working-agent/githooks/guards.d
